    <coordinates>
      <x>95</x>
      <y>10699</y>
      <w>1050</w>
      <h>150</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>ARCHITECTURE LIMITS: UC07 has no selectLoadout application operation or explicit selected-loadout
attachment. This diagram returns verified choices but does not invent selection persistence.
DeviceLocationProvider is the specified external integration port; its concrete adapter/OS API is
deferred. Strategy selection wiring is not exposed by PlanningService; configured strategy is
assumed.
fontsize=17
bg=#FFFBEF</panel_attributes>
